cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "rocker-bayes: A Docker image for Bayesian data analysis in R"
abstract: >-
  A Docker image for Bayesian data analysis in R, building on rstudio2u
  (r2u + RStudio Server + Quarto) with CmdStan and a curated set of R
  packages (brms, rstan, rstanarm, cmdstanr, easystats, tidybayes, and more),
  for AMD64 and ARM64.
type: software
authors:
